## What to Look for in an AV Rental Company

A few things worth checking before you book with any provider:

-   **A full service delivery model.** Ask whether the company delivers, installs and collects the equipment, or whether you are expected to pick it up and set it up yourself.
-   **Transparent, itemized pricing.** You should see exactly what is included in the price, not a vague quote.
-   **Clarity on technician support.** Ask whether a technician is included on your specific package or only available as an add on.
-   **Real experience in your area.** A local provider understands venue logistics and delivery timing on the Costa del Sol.

For more on how this applies to a specific event type, see our [corporate events](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-corporate-events/) and [corporate meetings](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-corporate-meetings/) pages.

