## FAQs

### How does audio visual equipment work?

Audio visual systems combine sound and visual technology: microphones and playback devices as inputs, mixers and amplifiers to process the signal, and speakers, projectors or displays as outputs, all working together to reach your audience.

### Is it cheaper to rent or buy a sound system?

Renting is generally more cost effective for a single event or occasional use, since it avoids the maintenance and storage costs of owning equipment you rarely use. Our [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) covers a small private event with sound, microphone and lighting included, delivered and collected for you.

### What is the audio visual rental process step by step?

Get a quote from our [packages page](/packages/), confirm your booking, and our crew handles delivery, installation and testing on the day. On packages with a technician, they stay on site during your event, then our crew returns afterward to collect everything. See [The Rental Process, Step by Step](#the-rental-process-step-by-step) above.

### Is setup and teardown included in the price, or is it extra?

Setup and teardown are always included in the price shown on our [packages page](/packages/). This is a full service delivery model: our crew installs, tests and collects the equipment, you never do it yourself.

### Why is technical support important during events with AV rentals?

A technician on site means a dropped microphone connection or a projector that will not sync gets fixed immediately, not after your event has already suffered for it. Whether a technician is included depends on your package: see [Technician Support](#technician-support-included-or-optional-depending-on-package) above.

### What types of events are suitable for audio visual rentals?

Audio visual rental suits weddings, corporate meetings and conferences, private parties, and product presentations, with a package sized to each: from the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) for a small private party up to the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) for a full conference.

### Can I change or cancel my AV rental booking?

Contact us as soon as you know about a change or cancellation, and we will do our best to accommodate it. Reach out via our [contact page](/contact/) to discuss your specific booking.

### Does Malaga Event Gear offer rental insurance for its AV equipment?

We do not publish an insurance product or a damage deposit policy for our equipment. Our delivery only model, professional installation, testing and collection by our own crew, is the real protection we offer, not an insurance line item. If a specific arrangement matters to your event, ask us directly at the quote stage rather than assume one exists.
